WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.503
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.904
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.372
Now, we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:08.975
President Biden today held
a bilateral meeting with

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.845
Italian Prime Minister
Mario Draghi to reaffirm

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.013
the partnership between
the two countries.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:17.183
Though I think he misunderstood
which partnership.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.819
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.654
President Biden has reportedly

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.422
told his national security
officials that

00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:25.624
recent press leaks about
intelligence sharing

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:27.160
with Ukraine need to stop

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.329
and could further inflame
tensions with Russia.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:32.632
So, remember, the Ukrainian
people have our full support,

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.701
but if anyone asks,
no, they don't.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.302
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.372
Congressional Republicans are
reportedly split over what to do

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:42.308
if the Supreme Court officially
overturns Roe v. Wade.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.776
Apparently, they can't decide

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:46.746
between a ticker-tape parade
or a dance party.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.715
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.851
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.319
I think it's a very fair point,

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.255
but I understand why
it was a huge bummer.

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:57.323
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.993
The Senate passed a bill
yesterday to expand security

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:02.562
for Supreme Court justices,
and just in time.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:06.099
Did you see how close that
lunatic got to Clarence Thomas?

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:09.569
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.937
150 personal items that belonged

00:01:11.937 --> 00:01:14.440
to the late Supreme Court
Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.310
recently sold in an auction
for over $800,000,

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:20.046
though I think some of
Kavanaugh's stuff got mixed in.

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:22.247
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:25.318
Authorities in Texas are looking
for a man who allegedly

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:28.721
burglarized a home and then
mowed the front and back lawns

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:29.989
before fleeing the scene.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:33.126
Police describe the suspect
as your dad.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:35.762
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.998
A dog that escaped from a yard
in Brooklyn over a week ago

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.933
was spotted swimming
in the East River

00:01:40.933 --> 00:01:42.835
then walking through
the Battery Tunnel

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:45.071
before he was rescued from
the parking lot

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:46.773
of a Home Depot in New Jersey.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.574
Though I'm not sure "rescued"
is the right word.

00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:50.677
It sounds more like
he was apprehended.

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:51.878
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:54.580
"Who told you where to find me?"

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:58.217
Authorities in Nevada have
reported finding several sets of

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:02.054
human remains over the last week
in Lake Mead as water levels

00:02:02.054 --> 00:02:04.023
drop amid an ongoing drought.

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:07.093
On the upside, the Mafia is now
very invested

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:08.861
in stopping climate change.

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:18.137
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:22.175
Artist Andy Warhol's silk-screen
portrait of Marilyn Monroe sold

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:25.111
yesterday at auction
for $195 million

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.580
and at Old Navy for $6.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.782
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:32.819
And finally, Starbucks added
a new drink to its menu today,

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:35.955
which is cold-brew coffee topped
with chocolate foam

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.724
and sweetened with
vanilla syrup.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:41.694
It's also their first drink
to come with the bathroom key.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.964
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:47.267
Well, that was the monologue,
everybody.

